            "Yes. The 14-day free trial unlocks every Pro feature, no credit card required. Enterprise prospects can also book a 30-minute demo with our solutions team to see workflows tailored to their stack."),
        new("g3", "general",
            "How do I migrate from another tool?",
            "We ship automated migration wizards for Asana, Trello, Monday, Jira, and Basecamp. They move projects, tasks, comments, attachments, and user mappings in one pass. Annual Enterprise plans include white-glove migration from our customer success team."),
        new("b1", "billing",
            "What payment methods and currencies do you support?",
            "Visa, Mastercard, Amex, and PayPal for monthly plans. Annual and Enterprise plans accept wire transfer or ACH. Pricing is shown in USD, EUR, GBP, CAD, and AUD with automatic conversion at checkout. All payments run through Stripe with PCI DSS Level 1 compliance."),
        new("b2", "billing",
            "How does per-seat pricing work?",
            "You're billed monthly or annually based on the number of active members in the workspace. Adding teammates mid-cycle is prorated; removing teammates credits your next invoice. Usage is calculated daily so you only pay for the seats you actually use."),
        new("b3", "billing",
            "Can I upgrade or downgrade my plan at any time?",
