            "What's your uptime SLA and backup policy?",
            "99.9% uptime SLA with credits for Enterprise customers if we miss it. Infrastructure runs on AWS multi-region with automatic failover. Real-time backups every six hours with point-in-time recovery available for 30 days."),
    ];
}
